#pattern matching for switch

the selection of which branch to execute is separated from
what to do when we execute that branch

changes included
1-case labels can include patterns and null
2-case labels can include optional when clauses("guard")
3-selection expression type broadened

from:
  -integral primitive types(excluding long), their corresponding wrapper
  types,String and enums
To:
 -integral primitive types(excluding long) and any reference type

 #Enum constant case labels improved
  -qualified enum constants now allowed